":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"9yB0gmPkZcY9","outputId":"180d5442-7f97-45e1-81ec-da0cddbf6465"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Muestras: 2319\n","y\n","0    0.737\n","1    0.263\n"]}],"source":["dfm = df[df['Estado nutricional según OMS 6 Meses'].notna()].copy()\n","dfm['y'] = (dfm['Estado nutricional según OMS 6 Meses'] != 'EUT').astype(int)\n","print('Muestras:', len(dfm))\n","print(dfm['y'].value_counts(normalize=True).round(3).to_string())"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"J6plP3HVZqiX"},"source":["Quedan **2.319 niños** con estado nutricional registrado a los 6 meses\n","(se descartaron los que no tienen esa etiqueta, porque el target no se imputa). La clase está\n","**desbalanceada**: ~**73,7 %** son `normal` y ~**26,3 %** `malnutrición`. Este desbalance es\n","clave, la *accuracy* sola será engañosa."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"LVBtqWFTZu04"},"source":["### Variables predictoras\n","\n","Intrahospitalarias y derivadas"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":107,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":247,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062334839,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"cs6TTntfZswa","outputId":"9635bf3b-a1eb-41cd-b5a2-a479da9737fd"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["13 numéricas + 19 categóricas\n"]}],"source":["# Derivadas que faltan a partir del df ya limpio\n","dfm['Tuvo_sepsis'] = (dfm['Sepsis tardía - germen primer evento'] != 220).astype(int)\n","dfm['Severidad DBP'] = dfm['Severidad DBP'].astype('Int64').astype(str)\n","for c in ['Tipo de parto', 'Paridad', 'Destino']:\n","    dfm[c] = dfm[c].astype('Int64').astype(str).replace('<NA>', 'NA')\n","dfm['Fenton al nacer'] = dfm['Fenton al nacer'].fillna('NA').astype(str)\n","\n","# Limpieza ligera de biometría al alta (errores de unidad / placeholders -> NaN)\n","dfm['Talla al alta'] = dfm['Talla al alta'].where(dfm['Talla al alta'].between(25, 80))\n","dfm['CC al alta']    = dfm['CC al alta'].where(dfm['CC al alta'].between(18, 45))\n","dfm['Peso al alta']  = dfm['Peso al alta'].where(dfm['Peso al alta'].between(400, 7000))\n","\n","num_features = ['Peso al nacer', 'EG al nacer', 'Edad de la madre', 'Score Neocosur',\n","                'Días de VM', 'Duración oxígeno días', 'EG_Alta', 'Peso al alta',\n","                'Talla al alta', 'CC al alta', 'Días de estadía', 'Edad_meses_al_alta',\n","                'indice_vulnerabilidad']\n","cat_features = ['Sexo', 'Multiple', 'Corticoides prenatales', 'Sulfato de magnesio',\n","                'Malformación congénita mayor', 'Hemorragia Intraventricular (HIV)',\n","                'Leucomalacia', 'Hidrocefalia', 'ECN', 'Recibe Surfactante',\n","                'O2 36 semanas', 'O2 domiciliario al alta', 'Tuvo_sepsis',\n","                'Severidad DBP', 'Tipo de parto', 'Paridad', 'Fenton al nacer',\n","                'Destino', 'País']\n","print(len(num_features), 'numéricas +', len(cat_features), 'categóricas')"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"X2kflrCFZzmF"},"source":["### Encoding + escalado\n","\n","one-hot encoding para las variables\n","categóricas y **MinMaxScaler** para todo (las numéricas se imputan con la mediana\n","porque KNN/PCA no admiten nulos)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":108,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":201,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335037,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"beF45hz3Zxkj","outputId":"bf69f51f-ba79-4335-acd4-106371b784f6"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Matriz de features (one-hot + escalada): (2319, 65)\n"]}],"source":["Xnum = dfm[num_features].apply(lambda s: s.fillna(s.median()))\n","Xcat = pd.get_dummies(dfm[cat_features].astype(str), drop_first=False)\n","X = pd.concat([Xnum, Xcat], axis=1).astype(float)\n","y = dfm['y'].values\n","\n","min_max_scaler = preprocessing.MinMaxScaler()\n","X = min_max_scaler.fit_transform(X)\n","print('Matriz de features (one-hot + escalada):', X.shape)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"c8weqo4mZ5Fp"},"source":["Tras aplicar one-hot encoding a las variables categóricas, la matriz de\n","features pasa a tener **65 columnas**. Es una dimensionalidad alta para un modelo basado en\n","distancias como KNN, por lo que a continuación reducimos con PCA."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"t2r3vmh6Z7pa"},"source":["### PCA\n","\n","Graficamos la curva de varianza\n","explicada y nos quedamos con las componentes necesarias para retener el 90%."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":109,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":19,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335059,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"z29O4LYvZ2nV","outputId":"91996772-805c-4395-faa5-24fc5b37e819"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Componentes para retener 90% de varianza: 19\n","Shape tras PCA: (2319, 19)\n"]}],"source":["pca_full = PCA().fit(X)\n","\n","def plot_var_curve(v):\n","    plt.plot(np.cumsum(v), lw=3)\n","    plt.grid(axis='y'); plt.xlabel('Componentes'); plt.ylabel('Varianza acumulada')\n","    plt.title('Varianza explicada acumulada'); plt.axhline(0.9, color='r', ls='--')\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","plot_var_curve(pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_)\n","\n","def min_var(v, exp_var):\n","    acc, i = 0, 0\n","    while acc < v:\n","        acc += exp_var[i]; i += 1\n","    return i\n","\n","n_comp = min_var(0.90, pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_)\n","print('Componentes para retener 90% de varianza:', n_comp)\n","\n","pca = PCA(n_components=n_comp)\n","X_ = pca.fit_transform(X)\n","print('Shape tras PCA:', X_.shape)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":109,"metadata":{"executionInfo":{"elapsed":5,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335068,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"Jge6oNYAgML7"},"outputs":[],"source":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"K57SFI5RZ_1a"},"source":["La curva de varianza acumulada (línea azul) crece rápido al principio y se\n","aplana después; la línea roja marca el 90 %. Se necesitan **19 componentes** para retener ese 90 %\n","de la información. Así reducimos de **65 → 19** dimensiones, conservando casi toda la varianza y\n","mitigando la *maldición de la dimensionalidad* que afecta a KNN."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"UFNpjmBnaFFn"},"source":["### Partición train / test (80/20)\n","\n","1.   Elemento de la lista\n","2.   Elemento de la lista\n","\n","\n","\n","Se estratifica por la clase para que la\n","prevalencia de malnutrición (~26%) se conserve en ambas particiones."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":110,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":194,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335268,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"aMB1nwSwZ_Y9","outputId":"fe3a2d83-37d8-451c-e7fb-9ad399f009d8"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Train: 1855  Test: 464\n","Referencia (clase mayoritaria) accuracy = 0.737\n"]}],"source":["X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n","    X_, y, test_size=0.2, random_state=RNG, stratify=y)\n","print('Train:', len(X_train), ' Test:', len(X_test))\n","\n","# Referencia trivial: accuracy si siempre predijéramos la clase mayoritaria\n","maj = pd.Series(y_test).value_counts(normalize=True).max()\n","print('Referencia (clase mayoritaria) accuracy =', round(maj, 3))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"Ij1ZdahnaJjR"},"source":["Partición estratificada: **1.855** niños para entrenar y **464** para\n","evaluar, manteniendo la proporción de clases. La **referencia de clase mayoritaria = 0,737** es el\n","piso trivial: un modelo que predijera siempre `normal` acertaría el 73,7 %. Cualquier modelo útil\n","debe superar (o al menos aportar algo más que) este valor."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"dV5mC98maMJq"},"source":["## Baseline: K-Vecinos Cercanos (KNN)\n","Probamos algunos valores de\n","*k* y reportamos con `classification_report` y la matriz de confusión."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":111,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":189,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335461,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"ZFuxBVP4aHH8","outputId":"4bd4e486-8fb1-4dcc-c2b3-41c7fa102700"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["k= 3  accuracy(test) = 0.681\n","k= 5  accuracy(test) = 0.731\n","k= 7  accuracy(test) = 0.735\n","k=11  accuracy(test) = 0.741\n","k=15  accuracy(test) = 0.726\n"]}],"source":["for k in [3, 5, 7, 11, 15]:\n","    clf = KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors=k).fit(X_train, y_train)\n","    print(f'k={k:2d}  accuracy(test) = {clf.score(X_test, y_test):.3f}')"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"DQeyrhnDaQOV"},"source":["La *accuracy* en test sube con `k` y se estabiliza: `k=11` alcanza\n","**0,741**, levemente por encima de la referencia. Pero, como la clase está desbalanceada, la\n","*accuracy* por sí sola no basta: hay que mirar el desempeño **por clase**."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":112,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":233,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335700,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"xK3l1toVaONf","outputId":"6db418cf-c96b-406e-f80e-c5d46729555f"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Accuracy (k=5): 0.731\n","\n","               precision    recall  f1-score   support\n","\n","      normal       0.77      0.91      0.83       342\n","malnutrición       0.48      0.24      0.32       122\n","\n","    accuracy                           0.73       464\n","   macro avg       0.62      0.57      0.57       464\n","weighted avg       0.69      0.73      0.70       464\n","\n"]}],"source":["# Baseline final con k=5 (valor por defecto usado en clase)\n","clf = KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors=5).fit(X_train, y_train)\n","y_pred = clf.predict(X_test)\n","\n","print('Accuracy (k=5):', round(clf.score(X_test, y_test), 3))\n","print('\\n', classification_report(y_test, y_pred,\n","      target_names=['normal', 'malnutrición'], zero_division=0))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"bnG5bT-KaZeR"},"source":["\n","- De los 122 niños con `malnutrición`, el modelo solo detecta **29**; los demás se le escapan.\n","- **Accuracy = 0,731**, prácticamente igual a la referencia trivial (0,737).\n","- **Recall de `malnutrición` = 0,24**: el baseline detecta solo **1 de cada 4** niños en riesgo.\n","\n","**Baseline supervisado.** La buena *accuracy* se sostiene casi solo por acertar la\n","clase mayoritaria; el modelo es pobre en lo que más importa clínicamente (identificar la\n","malnutrición). Esto es justamente lo que un baseline debe revelar: fija el piso y deja en evidencia\n","el desafío del **desbalance**, que las etapas siguientes deberán abordar."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"FLCPO56g_ukh"},"source":["## Mejora del baseline supervisado: ajuste del KNN\n","\n","El baseline KNN tiene buena *accuracy* (0,73) pero un **recall de malnutrición de solo 0,24**: por el desbalance (*74* % normal / 26 % malnutrición) tiende a predecir siempre «normal». Acá probamos si se puede subir ese recall **ajustando el propio KNN** —el número de vecinos `k` y la ponderación `weights`—, que es la herramienta de clasificación supervisada del curso.\n","\n","Métricas: `classification_report` y matriz de confusión"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":113,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":363},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":25,"status":"ok","timestamp":1782062335717,"user":{"displayName":"Franco Nicolai Corvalán Mansourova","userId":"03669814590806608851"},"user_tz":240},"id":"1N__KHyj_vK1","outputId":"bc2e2478-6df6-44a6-97d0-44c599891327"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["    weights   k  recall_malnut  accuracy\n","0   uniform   5          0.238     0.731\n","1   uniform  11          0.148     0.741\n","2   uniform  15          0.098     0.726\n","3   uniform  21          0.074     0.739\n","4   uniform  31          0.066     0.746\n","5  distance   5          0.246     0.685\n","6  distance  11          0.205     0.711\n","7  distance  15          0.156     0.703\n","8  distance  21          0.131     0.716\n","9  distance  31          0.082     0.716"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-b0dd2729-08ad-4e68-909c-cdbd5797df88\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>weights</th>\n","      <th>k</th>\n","      <th>recall_malnut</th>\n","      <th>accuracy</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead>\n","  <tbody>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>0</th>\n","      <td>uniform</td>\n","      <td>5</td>\n","      <td>0.238</td>\n","      <td>0.731</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>1</th>\n","      <td